NC Digital provides website maintenance for businesses across Dolgellau and Gwynedd — keeping your site updated, secure, and performing well.

## Why maintenance matters

An unmaintained website is a security risk. Outdated plugins and themes are the most common cause of hacked websites. Our maintenance packages keep your site protected and up to date.

## What's included

- Monthly WordPress and plugin updates
- Daily automated backups
- Security monitoring and malware scanning
- Uptime monitoring with instant alerts
- Content updates included

## Frequently asked questions

**Do I need maintenance if my site is new?**
Yes — all WordPress sites need ongoing updates to stay secure.

